<div class="brad-reply-to"></div>
<p>I couldnt agree more.  Instead of cover things fairly, the last 7 1/2 years have been an effort to make The president look as bad as possible with no regard for anything else. No regard for the soldiers fighting the war. No regard for anyting but their blind hatred for a sitting president. The liberal press consistently ignored stories that did not fit their narative.  Take the BradBlog for example.  A canididate that The readers loved and wrote fondly of has been caught cheating on his wife while she was fighting cancer.  Any story about that here? Of course not, it doesnt fit the impeach Bush narative.</p></div>
