						<img alt='' src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2042%2042%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/81d55f1a6bfe747f645fd2afda026c2ba99c51a237f1d554ba07c9791bfc82dd?s=42&#038;d=initials&#038;r=r&#038;initials=A9' data-srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/81d55f1a6bfe747f645fd2afda026c2ba99c51a237f1d554ba07c9791bfc82dd?s=84&#038;d=initials&#038;r=r&#038;initials=A9 2x' class='avatar avatar-42 photo lazy' height='42' width='42' decoding='async'/>						<b class="fn"><a href="http://neufneuf.blogspot.com" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Agent 99</a></b> <span class="says">says:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

