					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://bradblog.com/?p=6260#comment-362368"><time datetime="2008-08-11T03:43:08-07:00">August 11, 2008 at 3:43 am</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
