					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><a href="https://bradblog.com/?p=20397">&#8216;Democrats Winning in Places They Haven&#8217;t Won in Generations&#8217;: &#8216;BradCast&#8217; 11/5/2026</a></h3>				</div>
